Flagstaff Aviation Discussion

Issued at 2341 UTC Saturday, August  9, 2025



.AVIATION...Sunday 10/00Z through Monday 11/00Z...Expect VFR

conditions with isolated -SHRA/-TSRA through 03Z. Localized areas

of haze/smoke due to fires around the area. Light winds overnight

will turn west-northwest with gusts 20-25kts on Sunday. Isolated 

to SCT -SHRA/-TSRA possible on Sunday afternoon, with gusty winds

around any showers.

OUTLOOK...Monday 11/00Z through Wednesday 13/00Z...Expect VFR

conditions with localized areas of haze/smoke from area fires. 

Look for daily chances for -SHRA/-TSRA, primarily across the 

higher terrain between 18Z-03Z. Outside of the gusty storm driven

winds, expect west to northwest winds at 5-15 kts gusting up to 

25 kts. Light and variable winds should return during the 

overnight periods.





