North Platte Aviation Discussion

Issued at 2324 UTC Saturday, August  9, 2025



.AVIATION /00Z TAFS THROUGH 00Z MONDAY/...

Issued at 620 PM CDT Sat Aug 9 2025

There is an isolated chance of thunderstorms this evening into

the overnight across portions of western and north central

Nebraska. If a storm impacts the terminals, gusty erratic winds

and hail will be the main concerns. Sfc winds outside of the

thunderstorms will be light out of the east to southeast this

evening around 5 kts, then become light and variable overnight.

Winds will then be out of the north to northeast for Sunday

around 5 to 10 kts.  





