.AVIATION...

(00Z TAFS)

Issued at 640 PM CDT Sat Aug 9 2025

VFR conditions are forecast at the terminals over the next 24

hours. Winds will start out of the south but will switch to out of

the north to northeast behind a front. Before the front gets to

the terminals, low level wind shear may develop at the sites, with

KGUY currently having the lowest potential so have not included it

in the TAF. There is a low chance for showers or storms late in

this TAF period but chances are too low to mention in the TAFs at

this time.

